# Build-context exclusions for Dockerfile.production (the context is the repo root).
# Host node_modules/bin/obj must stay out: COPY would overwrite the Linux build's
# copies with macOS ones.
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
.git
.claude
.vscode
DOCS
ResultsArchive
semgrep-reports
AmrGrandPrix.API.Tests

# Secrets stay out of the image. The client's .env only holds the public Turnstile
# site key, which Vite needs at build time.
**/.env*
!AmrGrandPrix.Client/.env
